        "",
        f"**{num(len(qs))} questions** · **{num(oa)} from an OA** · **{num(n_companies)} companies** · {num(early)} intern & new grad · "
        f"{num(recent)} reported in the last {RECENT_DAYS} days · {num(free)} free",
